{"data":{"body":"**P2:** Continuation admission remains open while the already-selected successful result is serialized and possibly checkpointed as an oversized payload. A READY continuation admitted during this window can fail, but this callback still returns `SUCCEEDED` because handler completion already won outcome selection. Call `beginInvocationEnd()` immediately before output preparation, and add a test that blocks serialization while a queued READY continuation fails.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774Ryz","finding_digest":"eec259eaa6e55371ed3dd836b70177d6400c09efa88c99a28a4e59f0bd3c3039","finding_id":"arf_v1_53bft2vg4vjxd3j53a3loalx2z","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::runcheckpointcontinuation::invocation-teardown-escape","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::runcheckpointcontinuation::invocation-teardown-escape","line":180,"observation_digest":"62a5ba05bfb0778285da55bddf5bf345c043973ac404ea85a31fefe0830d0122","observation_id":"aro_v1_mks3ubn7wb3yfbo2kw656w7tix","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_53bft2vg4vjxd3j53a3loalx2z","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:19Z","review_id":"arr_v1_cu4zeb5k3rkfj3fado7e3kadxg","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"eb449c4cada52414f687bb5b3ae9362a917448f2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":179,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_5vjb2jthwfcrjdzys4pguzcw5f","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:19Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
